  "text": {
    "title": "Lean Garrison",
    "body": "With half the company detached along the supply road, only a lean watch holds Crosswall Courtyard. Plug the narrow stone lanes and survive three probing assaults without losing both halls.",
    "obj.0": "Hold Crosswall Courtyard against all three assaults",
    "msg.1": "Hold the north lane! Lock your shields and do not let their shock troops breach the courtyard behind our archers!",
    "msg.1.who": "Vanguard Toma",
    "msg.2": "Raiders at the southern lane! Shift the shield wall south!",
    "msg.2.who": "Sergeant Hal",
    "msg.3": "Golems coming down the eastern lane—break their mages first!",
    "msg.3.who": "Captain Isolde",
    "msg.4": "The lanes are choked with fallen raiders. Crosswall holds!",
    "msg.4.who": "Vanguard Toma",
    "win": "Crosswall Courtyard holds firm despite a lean garrison.",
    "fail.1": "Your hero has fallen in Crosswall Courtyard.",
    "fail.2": "Both garrison halls have burned. Crosswall is lost."
  },
